# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only documents (deliberately NOT shared in this repo)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The app's contract is SPEC.md and the roadmap is todo.md (both tracked). These stay on
# disk only:
#   CODE_STYLE.md — internal house style guide
#   lessons.md    — measured Electrobun traps/lessons (may name machine-local paths)
#   debug.md      — live scratchpad for ONE open bug: measured evidence, ranked theories and the
#                   pending experiment list. Machine-local paths and harness notes; worthless once
#                   the bug is closed (its durable lesson belongs in lessons.md).
CODE_STYLE.md
lessons.md
debug.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/

